msgid "You're kidding! That much? I could never afford that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"(That's cheaper than any two-bedroom I've ever seen. If she can't afford "
"that, I don't think she'll ever manage in Tokyo.)"
msgstr ""

